# Error.captureStackTrace() lays `stack` on what it is handed without a descriptor and without a store: native code puts the property straight on the object. Here that is a class object, its prototype object, a closure, a constructor function and its prototype object behind its first object.
# RUN: run-in-shell
# CHECK: string string string string string
# CHECK-NEXT: make say plain weigh 1 0 true
# CHECK-NEXT: exited with 0
